Z||000000||G25C||09-12-1999||01:19 AM||||<BR>Well, the Fiero Gt that ive dreamed of having since i was 13 (when it first came out) and now own...i have to sell.<P>Not cause i want to, but because i HAVE to.  I work at a factory that supplies Ford with air/heat duct parts.  This other factory (and ive been told lots other Ford plants) or talking about striking.  If they strike, ill be on unemployment for however long this thing  gets settled or untill i find a job on the side.<P>But im a single dad and there is no way i can keep a hold of my GT and make it if i get laid off.<P>Im posting the info for it on the MALL at this forum.  I hate to have to sell it...I LOVE THIS DAMN CAR!!!<P>please give the post a look at if you or someone you know is interested.||||reg||9
